Q. where is Token stored
A. - x - local storage --attacker can run the script and get the token on client side.
A. - x - cookies --form action="/api/account/transaction/:xyz" method="POST"
A. - x - memory --data is lost as soon as tab is reloaded.
A. So we use 1. Access token 2. Refresh token

Access Token --will be used for transactions, Expiry : 10-15 mins
Refresh Token --will never be used for trancactions, only used to generate a new Access token. Expiry : 7 - 15 days

cookie-parser > too store and retrive data from cookies.

